  "question": {
    "text": "The kinetic energy <math><mi>K</mi></math> of a particle moving along a circle of radius <math><mi>R</mi></math> depends on the distance covered s, as <math><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math> where, a is constant. Then the force acting on the particle is",
